// `println` was removed; `print.ln` is the replacement. print.ln is a Zig
// comptime transform with no JS variant yet (JS target is immature), so this
// verifies print.ln on Zig. KNOWN GAP: print.ln cross-target JS — print's JS
// path emits Zig `std.debug.print` instead of `console.log`. Tracked separately.
import std/io

~std/io:print.ln("Hello, world!")
